{"seq":3,"slug":"context-receivers","title":"上下文接收者","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/context-receivers","wordCount":739,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"上下文接收者\">上下文接收者</h1><p>上下文接收者（Context Receivers）是 Kotlin 中一项实验性特性，允许为函数声明多个隐式接收者。它解决了扩展函数只能有一个接收者的限制，使得需要多个上下文的场景更加优雅。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>上下文接收者的核心是<strong>为函数声明多个隐式接收者</strong>：传统扩展函数只允许一个接收者，<code>context(...)</code> 语法让函数同时依赖多个上下文对象，调用时由作用域自动解析，无需逐个显式传参。它把「一个函数需要多份上下文」从参数列表里的显式依赖，改写为作用域内的隐式约束。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>传统的扩展函数只能有一个接收者：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 只能有一个接收者&#10;fun Transaction.saveUser(user: User) { /* ... */ }&#10;&#10;// 如果同时需要 Logger 上下文呢？&#10;// fun Transaction.Logger.saveUser(user: User) { } // 不合法！\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 只能有一个接收者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Transaction.saveUser(user: User) { /* ... */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果同时需要 Logger 上下文呢？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// fun Transaction.Logger.saveUser(user: User) { } // 不合法！</span></span></code></pre></div><p>现有的解决方案都有局限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参数传递</td>\n<td>代码冗长，调用处不够简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套扩展函数</td>\n<td>只能有一层嵌套接收者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口继承组合</td>\n<td>类型膨胀，不灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局或 ThreadLocal</td>\n<td>不类型安全，难以管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"context-语法\">context() 语法</h2><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 上下文接收者目前是实验性特性，需要添加编译器参数 <code>-Xcontext-receivers</code>。Kotlin 团队正在重新设计该特性，未来语法可能变化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"context(Logger, Transaction)&#10;fun saveUser(user: User) {&#10;    log(&quot;保存用户: ${user.name}&quot;)  // 来自 Logger&#10;    execute(&quot;INSERT INTO users VALUES (&#39;${user.name}&#39;)&quot;)  // 来自 Transaction&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>context(Logger, Transaction)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun saveUser(user: User) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log(\"保存用户: ${user.name}\")  // 来自 Logger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    execute(\"INSERT INTO users VALUES ('${user.name}')\")  // 来自 Transaction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用时需要在正确的上下文中调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface Logger {&#10;    fun log(message: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Transaction {&#10;    fun execute(sql: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun demo(logger: Logger, tx: Transaction) {&#10;    with(logger) {&#10;        with(tx) {&#10;            saveUser(User(&quot;张三&quot;)) // 两个上下文都可用&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface Logger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun log(message: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Transaction {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun execute(sql: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun demo(logger: Logger, tx: Transaction) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    with(logger) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        with(tx) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            saveUser(User(\"张三\")) // 两个上下文都可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;context(Logger, Transaction)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;函数体内可访问&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Logger.log()&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Transaction.execute()&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;正常参数 user&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"context(Logger, Transaction)\"] --&gt; B[\"函数体内可访问\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Logger.log()\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Transaction.execute()\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"正常参数 user\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"多接收者示例\">多接收者示例</h2><h3 id=\"日志-配置上下文\">日志 + 配置上下文</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface AppConfig {&#10;    val maxRetries: Int&#10;    val timeout: Long&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Logger {&#10;    fun log(message: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;context(AppConfig, Logger)&#10;fun fetchWithRetry(url: String): String {&#10;    repeat(maxRetries) { attempt -&gt;       // 来自 AppConfig&#10;        log(&quot;第 ${attempt + 1} 次尝试: $url&quot;) // 来自 Logger&#10;        try {&#10;            return httpGet(url, timeout)   // 来自 AppConfig&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            log(&quot;失败: ${e.message}&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    throw RuntimeException(&quot;超过最大重试次数&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface AppConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val maxRetries: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val timeout: Long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Logger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun log(message: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context(AppConfig, Logger)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun fetchWithRetry(url: String): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(maxRetries) { attempt ->       // 来自 AppConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        log(\"第 ${attempt + 1} 次尝试: $url\") // 来自 Logger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return httpGet(url, timeout)   // 来自 AppConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            log(\"失败: ${e.message}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    throw RuntimeException(\"超过最大重试次数\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"领域建模\">领域建模</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface MoneyContext {&#10;    val currency: String&#10;    fun formatAmount(amount: Double): String&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TaxContext {&#10;    val taxRate: Double&#10;}&#10;&#10;context(MoneyContext, TaxContext)&#10;fun calculateTotal(subtotal: Double): String {&#10;    val tax = subtotal * taxRate                // 来自 TaxContext&#10;    val total = subtotal + tax&#10;    return formatAmount(total)                   // 来自 MoneyContext&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface MoneyContext {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val currency: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun formatAmount(amount: Double): String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface TaxContext {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val taxRate: Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context(MoneyContext, TaxContext)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun calculateTotal(subtotal: Double): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val tax = subtotal * taxRate                // 来自 TaxContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val total = subtotal + tax</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return formatAmount(total)                   // 来自 MoneyContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"与扩展函数的对比\">与扩展函数的对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>扩展函数</th>\n<th>上下文接收者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>接收者数量</td>\n<td>1 个</td>\n<td>多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用语法</td>\n<td><code>obj.func()</code></td>\n<td>在上下文作用域内直接调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要用途</td>\n<td>为已有类添加方法</td>\n<td>声明函数依赖的多个上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可发现性</td>\n<td>通过 IDE 自动补全</td>\n<td>需要在正确作用域内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>实验性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 扩展函数：适合&quot;对象.操作&quot;的语义&#10;fun String.toSlug(): String = this.lowercase().replace(&quot; &quot;, &quot;-&quot;)&#10;&#10;// 上下文接收者：适合&quot;在某个上下文中执行操作&quot;的语义&#10;context(Logger)&#10;fun String.logAndProcess(): String {&#10;    log(&quot;处理: $this&quot;)         // Logger 上下文&#10;    return this.uppercase()    // String 扩展接收者&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 扩展函数：适合\"对象.操作\"的语义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun String.toSlug(): String = this.lowercase().replace(\" \", \"-\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 上下文接收者：适合\"在某个上下文中执行操作\"的语义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context(Logger)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun String.logAndProcess(): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log(\"处理: $this\")         // Logger 上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return this.uppercase()    // String 扩展接收者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"作用域控制\">作用域控制</h2><p>上下文接收者可以与 <code>@DslMarker</code> 配合，控制嵌套作用域中的可见性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@DslMarker&#10;annotation class ServiceDsl&#10;&#10;@ServiceDsl&#10;interface DatabaseScope {&#10;    fun query(sql: String): List&lt;Map&lt;String, Any&gt;&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;@ServiceDsl&#10;interface CacheScope {&#10;    fun get(key: String): String?&#10;    fun put(key: String, value: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;context(DatabaseScope, CacheScope)&#10;fun getCachedUser(id: Long): Map&lt;String, Any&gt;? {&#10;    val cached = get(&quot;user:$id&quot;)                          // CacheScope&#10;    if (cached != null) return mapOf(&quot;name&quot; to cached)&#10;&#10;    val results = query(&quot;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $id&quot;) // DatabaseScope&#10;    results.firstOrNull()?.let { user -&gt;&#10;        put(&quot;user:$id&quot;, user[&quot;name&quot;].toString())          // CacheScope&#10;    }&#10;    return results.firstOrNull()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@DslMarker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>annotation class ServiceDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@ServiceDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface DatabaseScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun query(sql: String): List&#x3C;Map&#x3C;String, Any>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@ServiceDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface CacheScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun get(key: String): String?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun put(key: String, value: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context(DatabaseScope, CacheScope)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun getCachedUser(id: Long): Map&#x3C;String, Any>? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cached = get(\"user:$id\")                          // CacheScope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (cached != null) return mapOf(\"name\" to cached)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val results = query(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $id\") // DatabaseScope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    results.firstOrNull()?.let { user -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        put(\"user:$id\", user[\"name\"].toString())          // CacheScope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return results.firstOrNull()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"迁移策略\">迁移策略</h2><p>由于上下文接收者仍在演进中，建议采用渐进式迁移：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[当前代码] --&gt; B{使用上下文接收者?}&#10;    B --&gt;|生产代码| C[使用接口 + 参数]&#10;    B --&gt;|DSL/框架代码| D[谨慎使用 context]&#10;    B --&gt;|实验项目| E[可以尝试]&#10;    C --&gt; F[未来迁移到 context]\">flowchart TD\n    A[当前代码] --&gt; B{使用上下文接收者?}\n    B --&gt;|生产代码| C[使用接口 + 参数]\n    B --&gt;|DSL/框架代码| D[谨慎使用 context]\n    B --&gt;|实验项目| E[可以尝试]\n    C --&gt; F[未来迁移到 context]</pre><p>当前推荐的替代模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 方案 1：参数传递&#10;fun saveUser(user: User, logger: Logger, tx: Transaction) {&#10;    logger.log(&quot;保存用户&quot;)&#10;    tx.execute(&quot;INSERT ...&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 方案 2：包装类&#10;class UserService(&#10;    private val logger: Logger,&#10;    private val tx: Transaction&#10;) {&#10;    fun saveUser(user: User) {&#10;        logger.log(&quot;保存用户&quot;)&#10;        tx.execute(&quot;INSERT ...&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 方案 3：作用域函数嵌套（短期可用）&#10;fun demo(logger: Logger, tx: Transaction) {&#10;    with(logger) {&#10;        with(tx) {&#10;            // 两个上下文都可用&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 方案 1：参数传递</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun saveUser(user: User, logger: Logger, tx: Transaction) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logger.log(\"保存用户\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tx.execute(\"INSERT ...\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方案 2：包装类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserService(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val logger: Logger,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val tx: Transaction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun saveUser(user: User) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        logger.log(\"保存用户\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tx.execute(\"INSERT ...\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方案 3：作用域函数嵌套（短期可用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun demo(logger: Logger, tx: Transaction) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    with(logger) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        with(tx) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 两个上下文都可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"编译器配置\">编译器配置</h2><p>启用上下文接收者需要添加编译器参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;tasks.withType&lt;KotlinCompile&gt; {&#10;    kotlinOptions {&#10;        freeCompilerArgs += &quot;-Xcontext-receivers&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tasks.withType&#x3C;KotlinCompile> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlinOptions {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        freeCompilerArgs += \"-Xcontext-receivers\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Kotlin 团队正在开发名为&quot;context parameters&quot;的新设计来替代当前的上下文接收者语法。关注 KEEP-259 提案了解最新进展。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>上下文接收者</strong>允许为函数声明多个隐式接收者，解决扩展函数的单接收者限制</li>\n<li>通过 <code>context(A, B)</code> 语法声明，函数体内可直接访问所有上下文成员</li>\n<li>与扩展函数的区别：上下文接收者表达&quot;在某个上下文中执行&quot;，扩展函数表达&quot;对象的操作&quot;</li>\n<li>目前仍是<strong>实验性特性</strong>，需要编译器参数 <code>-Xcontext-receivers</code></li>\n<li>生产代码建议使用接口 + 参数或包装类作为替代，DSL/框架代码可以谨慎使用</li>\n<li>Kotlin 团队正在开发 context parameters 新设计，未来语法可能变化</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"上下文接收者","id":"上下文接收者"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"context() 语法","id":"context-语法"},{"level":2,"text":"多接收者示例","id":"多接收者示例"},{"level":3,"text":"日志 + 配置上下文","id":"日志-配置上下文"},{"level":3,"text":"领域建模","id":"领域建模"},{"level":2,"text":"与扩展函数的对比","id":"与扩展函数的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"作用域控制","id":"作用域控制"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移策略","id":"迁移策略"},{"level":2,"text":"编译器配置","id":"编译器配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/contracts"},"next":{"title":"编译器插件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/compiler-plugins"}}